   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Quanto mais..., mais...»",
     "texto": [
      "**Quanto mais compras, mais dívidas tens** (the more you buy, the more debts you have). It's the «the more..., the more...» structure. It can be changed: **quanto menos, melhor** (the less, the better)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impersonal and passive with «se»",
     "texto": [
      "In **Compra-se online**, the verb is singular and there's no expressed subject: it's an impersonal construction. In **Vendem-se produtos**, **produtos** is the patient subject and the verb agrees in plural: it's a synthetic passive.",
      "Don't call both of them “impersonal passive”: agreement lets you tell them apart."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Consumer tips",
     "texto": [
      "**É preciso que pesquises o preço** means “you need to look up the price”. To say “compare the price” you say **comparar o preço**. With **poupança** (savings) you avoid debt."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
